{"unit_id":"Tianyu209__dsh-browser-companion#card-zh","repo":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","commit":"02860d005494d9294d3ad4b95ad373a746b2c69d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-companion 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的浏览器自动化插件，为 Agent 提供可见、持久的浏览器会话。它通过 agent-browser CLI 执行导航与页面操作，并在 Web 设置中配置浏览器路径、profile 和超时。主要功能包括打开网页、读取页面快照和文本、点击及填写表单、管理标签页、保存截图，以及由用户在弹出的浏览器中手动登录并等待登录状态。可选的 browser_see 会把截图交给配置的视觉模型生成描述；默认地址是本机服务。适合需要让 DSH Agent 浏览网页、操作页面或配合人工完成登录的场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:356-373","src/index.js:376-399","src/index.js:488-512","src/index.js:799-868"]}
{"unit_id":"Tianyu209__dsh-browser-companion#card-en","repo":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","commit":"02860d005494d9294d3ad4b95ad373a746b2c69d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-browser-companion adds a visible, persistent browser to DSH Web. Agents can open pages, inspect content, interact with controls, manage tabs, and save screenshots. Users can log in manually while the agent waits for a URL or cookie. An optional vision tool describes screenshots through a model.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:356-373","src/index.js:376-399","src/index.js:488-512","src/index.js:799-868"]}
