{"unit_id":"Tianyu209__dsh-browser-companion#feature-1","repo":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","commit":"02860d005494d9294d3ad4b95ad373a746b2c69d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-companion 的功能「在可见浏览器中打开网页」：调用 browser_open 打开 URL，并可等待页面加载状态；headless 配置决定是否显示窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:356-373"]}
{"unit_id":"Tianyu209__dsh-browser-companion#feature-2","repo":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","commit":"02860d005494d9294d3ad4b95ad373a746b2c69d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-companion 的功能「读取页面并定位交互元素」：browser_snapshot 返回带元素引用的可访问性快照，browser_get_text 读取指定元素文本，供后续操作使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:376-399"]}
{"unit_id":"Tianyu209__dsh-browser-companion#feature-3","repo":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","commit":"02860d005494d9294d3ad4b95ad373a746b2c69d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-companion 的功能「操作网页控件与标签页」：Agent 可点击元素、填写非密码输入框、按键、选择下拉选项，并创建、列出、切换或关闭标签页。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:401-464"]}
{"unit_id":"Tianyu209__dsh-browser-companion#feature-4","repo":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","commit":"02860d005494d9294d3ad4b95ad373a746b2c69d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-companion 的功能「由用户完成登录并等待状态」：browser_login 打开登录页供用户手动输入；browser_wait_login 可轮询 URL 模式或 Cookie 名称判断是否完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:799-857"]}
{"unit_id":"Tianyu209__dsh-browser-companion#feature-5","repo":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","commit":"02860d005494d9294d3ad4b95ad373a746b2c69d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-companion 的功能「截图并请求本地视觉描述」：browser_screenshot 将页面截图保存到本地；可选 browser_see 把截图发送到配置的视觉模型并返回文字描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:466-512"]}
{"unit_id":"Tianyu209__dsh-browser-companion#caveat-1","repo":"Tianyu209/dsh-browser-companion","commit":"02860d005494d9294d3ad4b95ad373a746b2c69d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-browser-companion 使用 browser_see 时会将页面截图发送到 visionBaseUrl 配置的视觉模型服务；默认地址为本机 127.0.0.1，配置远程地址后截图也会发往该服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:34-37","src/index.js:279-315"]}
